  "sourceTitle": "Liberian Pound Cake",
  "sourceText": "Liberian Pound Cake\nBy: Helen Pitlick\nPublished: Sunday, December 13, 2009 - 11:12pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 pound butter\n4 eggs\n1 cup evaporated milk\n1 pound sugar\n1 pound flour\n4 teaspoons baking powder\n1 teaspoon vanilla\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Cream sugar and butter. Add eggs, vanilla, milk. Sift baking powder and flour together and mix all together well. Bake in moderate oven until toothpick tested.",
